cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use EpiRefine, please cite the version you used (epirefine --version). A manuscript is in
  preparation; until it is published, cite the software as below.
type: software
title: "EpiRefine: refine metagenome bins from nanopore methylation"
abstract: >-
  EpiRefine flags binned contigs whose DNA methylation contradicts their bin and places unbinned contigs
  into the bin their methylation fits, with calibrated probabilities. Inputs are an assembly, a contig-bin
  table, a modkit pileup and a motif table (for example from Nanomotif).
version: 0.12.0rc1
authors:
